    <div class="bard-content !mb-0">
        
        <h3>The Phantom of the Opera Drama Workshop</h3><p>During this fascinating 60-minute movement workshop, students will learn what it takes to bring a haunting ghost story to life on stage. They will explore key aspects of performance such as creating soundscapes, building tension within the scene, character work, and storytelling through movement.</p><p><strong>Cost: £250 | Suitable ages 14+ | Running time: 1 hour</strong></p>
    </div>
    


