                        <!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->                        
    
    <div class="bard-content !mb-0">
        
        <h3>The Phantom of the Opera Musical Theatre Workshop</h3><p>During this 90-minute workshop, students explore how character, movement and storytelling are used to create the world of <strong><em>The Phantom of the Opera</em></strong>. With an introduction to vocal technique, students then learn music from the iconic <em>Masquerade</em>, as they create their own performance inspired by this breath-taking production.</p><p><strong>Cost: £450 | Suitable ages 14+ | Running time: 1 hour 30 minutes</strong></p>
    </div>
    


